<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Electronics IPO to trade Thursday.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Electronics IPO to trade Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Electronics Industrial Co Ltd's initial public offering (IPO) will begin trading on Thursday, the Korea Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>Hyundai, a semiconductor making arm of the Hyundai Group HYGR.CN, will list 10 million new shares.</p>
<p>Hyundai's IPO was held on November 19-20, with the subscription price set at 20,000 won per share.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
